@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Audit logging: controllers, MonitoringHub and services call AuditService explicitly (no middleware). Add() stages a
' row that the caller's SaveChanges commits with the change itself; LogAsync() = Add + SaveChanges at once (LOGIN_FAILED,
' DEVICE_MISMATCH, MONITORING_VIOLATION ...). AppDbContext.SaveChanges[Async] -> AuditChain.SaveSealed[Async]: process
' WriterLock + pg_advisory_xact_lock, read the head, Seal() (Sequence, PrevHash, Hash = SHA-256 over PrevHash and the
' row's fields; genesis PrevHash = 64 zeros), base SaveChanges, commit - sealing happens inside that one save.
' Viewing (AuditLogsPage, PrivateRoute Admin,SuperAdmin; AuditController [Authorize(Roles = "Admin,SuperAdmin")]):
' getLogs (GET /api/audit-logs?take=200) and verifyChain (GET /api/audit-logs/verify) run in parallel; filtering is
' client-side. VerifyAsync has three outcomes: valid, BrokenAt set, or unsealed rows (Valid = false, BrokenAt = null)
' -> "n entries not sealed yet" + "Seal legacy entries" -> POST /api/audit-logs/backfill (AUDIT_CHAIN_BACKFILLED),
' then verify again.
' Printed pt = fontSize * 72 * printed_width_in / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 28
skinparam ArrowFontSize 27
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #777777
  TitleFontSize 29
}
|Server|
|Admin (AuditLogsPage)|
|Server|
start
:Write path, on every audited action:
a controller, hub or service calls
AuditService: actor (null: System),
event type, entity, details JSON,
e.g. DEVICE_BOUND, GRADE_OVERRIDDEN;
if (Standalone\nevent?) then ([yes])
  :LogAsync:
  SaveChanges
  at once
  (LOGIN_FAILED,
  DEVICE_MISMATCH);
else ([no])
  :Add: staged, the
  caller's SaveChanges
  commits it with the
  change
  (SEAT_MISMATCH);
endif
:SaveChanges seals the new rows (AuditChain):
process lock + pg_advisory_xact_lock, next
Sequence, PrevHash = head Hash (genesis:
64 zeros), Hash = SHA-256(PrevHash, fields),
commit;
end
|Admin (AuditLogsPage)|
start
:View path: signed-in
user opens
/admin/audit-logs;
if (Admin or\nSuperAdmin?) then ([no])
  :PrivateRoute redirects
  (API returns 403);
  end
else ([yes])
endif
fork
  |Server|
  :GET /api/audit-logs
  (take 200): newest
  first, actor name
  or System;
fork again
  |Server|
  :GET /api/audit-logs
  /verify recomputes
  every Hash;
end fork
|Admin (AuditLogsPage)|
:List rows, filter by
event type and search
text in the page;
switch (Verify\nresult?)
case ([valid])
  :Badge "Chain
  verified (n
  entries)";
case ([brokenAt])
  :Badge "Chain
  broken at #n",
  reason;
case ([unsealed])
  :Badge "n entries
  not sealed yet";
  if (Admin clicks\nSeal legacy\nentries?) then ([yes])
    |Server|
    :POST /api/audit-logs
    /backfill: seal old rows,
    oldest first, + AUDIT_
    CHAIN_BACKFILLED,
    verify again;
    |Admin (AuditLogsPage)|
  else ([no])
  endif
endswitch
end
@enduml
